# WORK IN PROGRESS, AND NOT MINE TO COMMIT.
#
# An agent is building this directory now. CLAUDE.md's rule is that a file a
# subagent owns is never committed on the strength of its compiling -- the
# check wanted is a diff somebody has read, and nobody has read these. They
# are ignored until that happens, because a `git add tools/` for a NEIGHBOURING
# directory swept one of them into cf1eee0 and it had to be taken back out.
*
!.gitignore
